msgid "Monthly plan"
msgstr "Plan mensuel"

msgid ""
"Turning on Monthly Plan allows the utility to charge customers a minimum "
"monthly fee for electricity to be used during the current month. Payment "
"for consumption of electricity during the current month is charged from "
"the Monthly Plan balance at the tariff price until the balance reaches "
"zero. Any consumption of electricity in the current month beyond this is "
"charged from pre-pay credits that may have been purchased by the customer"
" during the month. At the end of the month, a new Monthly Plan balance is"
" automatically filled for customers who have more pre-pay credit in their"
" account than the Monthly Plan minimum fee."
msgstr ""
"Activer le Plan mensuel permet au fournisseur de service de définir un prix "
"mensuel minimum que les clients doivent acquitter. Le paiement pour la "
"consommation d'électricité durant le mois en cours est déduite en priorité "
"des crédits restants sur le Plan mensuel. Toute consommation au-delà du prix "
"du Plan mensuel est prélevée sur les crédits pré-payés que le client a "
"disponible.A la fin du mois, le Plan mensuel est à nouveau alimenté avec des "
"crédits pré-payés si le client a suffisamment de crédits pour cela."

